#: npc/merchants/refine.txt#18 (mes)
- "[Christopher Guillenrow]"
+ "[Christopher Guillenrow]"
#: npc/merchants/refine.txt#19 (mes)
- "This one is the best among all me stuffs in me workshop! With this, ye can rule the Blacksmith world! Thank ye fer shopping at me workshop.  Feel free to come anytime, whenever ye need."
+ "Essa é a melhor de tudo que tenho aqui! Com ela tu domina o mundo dos Ferreiros! Obrigado por comprar na minha oficina. Aparece quando precisar."
#: npc/merchants/refine.txt#20 (mes)
- "[Christopher Guillenrow]"
+ "[Christopher Guillenrow]"
#: npc/merchants/refine.txt#21 (mes)
- "Well, sorry. But I don't have anythin' harder' than the Golden Anvil."
+ "Pois é, sinto muito. Não tenho nada mais duro que a Bigorna Dourada."
#: npc/merchants/refine.txt#22 (mes)
- "[Christopher Guillenrow]"
+ "[Christopher Guillenrow]"
#: npc/merchants/refine.txt#23 (mes)
- "Me thinks 'Ringgel,' the Legendary Anvil Maker would have one. But, I don't think ye can find him, though he be somewhere in this world."
+ "Acho que o 'Ringgel', o lendário fabricante de bigornas, teria uma. Mas duvido que tu ache ele, mesmo estando em algum canto deste mundo."
